	"Author": "slpOff",
	"AuthorLabel": "slO",
	"Description": "MotionFramework is a simple but powerful system that allows modders to create [b]custom farmer animations[/b].Place your PNG and JSON files inside a motion folder, and the framework automatically loads them, registers Content Patcher tokens, and enables them through Trigger Actions or API calls.[b]Features[/b][list]\n<br />[*]Custom animations using only PNG + JSON(Custom Farmer Sprite)\n<br />[*]Direction and gender support (male/female, 0–3 directions)\n<br />[*]Frame offsets, rotation, and flip\n<br />[*]Built-in CP token integration\n<br />[*]Trigger Actions for events/maps/dialogues\n<br />[*]Optional C# API for advanced usage\n<br />[/list]",
